<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:13:40 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>超越大脑的意识</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/consciousness-beyond-the-brain</link><description>大多数科学家认为意识是由大脑创造的。毕竟，大多数人认为如果大脑被破坏，意识就会消失。但如果这种共识观点是根本错误的呢？与杰出的剑桥科学家鲁珀特·谢尔德雷克一起探讨思想超越大脑的观点，并探讨这一说法的根本含义。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/consciousness-beyond-the-brain.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:13:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/consciousness-beyond-the-brain</guid></item><item><title>自闭症突变重新连接蛋白质相互作用网络</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/rewiring-of-protein-interaction-networks-by-autism-mutations</link><description>二十多年来，研究人员已经发现了数百个增加自闭症谱系障碍（ASD）风险的基因。然而，仍有多个基本问题尚未得到解答：其中，这些基因的突变如何直接导致大脑发育的变化，以及如何将这些知识转化为更有效的疗法？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rewiring-of-protein-interaction-networks-by-autism-mutations2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:58:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/rewiring-of-protein-interaction-networks-by-autism-mutations</guid></item><item><title>Token缓存秘密：AI企业成本降低80%</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/token-caching-secrets-cut-ai-enterprise-costs-by-80</link><description>令牌缓存可降低企业 AI 成本 80% &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/token-caching-secrets-cut-ai-enterprise-costs-by-802.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:43:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/token-caching-secrets-cut-ai-enterprise-costs-by-80</guid></item><item><title>这些波浪轮永远改变了滑板运动！ 🛹🔥 |创智赢家美国</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/these-wavy-wheels-c